        "type": "paragraph",
        "snippet": "The average cost to reroof a house in Utah ranges from $8,500 to $19,500 for a standard-sized home with asphalt shingles. Total project costs typically break down by home size, ranging from $8,000 to $12,000\n\nfor small homes, $12,000 to $18,000 for medium homes, and upwards of $20,000+ for large or complex properties.",
