        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "snippet": "Key Price Factors in Utah"
      },
      {
        "type": "list",
        "list": [
          {
            "snippet": "Size and Pitch: Steeper roofs require specialized safety equipment and extra labor, increasing the overall price per square foot."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Tear-Off Requirements:\nRemoving multiple existing layers of old shingles adds to disposal and labor fees."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Climate Add-ons: Utah's heavy winter snow and ice demand robust underlayment and ice-and-water shields, which affect final line items."
          },
          {
            "snippet": "Local Labor:\nRates can vary depending on whether you hire a local contractor in major metro areas along the Wasatch Front or in more remote mountain regions."
          }
        ],
        "reference_indexes": [
          8,
          9
        ]
